-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1000: a written ASSUME and a section GIVEN in one export.
-- The ASSUME is redefined over the row, as it always was; the section GIVEN is
-- supplied by name at the call, and one read of it is overridden by an inner
-- WITH. For b 1, `flat fee` 10 and r 3: 1 + 10 + 3 + 100.

ASSUME `flat fee` IS A NUMBER

§ `Rates`
    GIVEN r IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
inner MEANS r

@export A written ASSUME beside a section GIVEN, one read overridden
GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
outer b MEANS b PLUS `flat fee` PLUS inner PLUS (inner WITH r IS 100)
